  "scope": [
    "Only independent visual state/geometry math is implemented; no Game/Ent/simulation/save/network fields were added or changed.",
    "Own WASM slots are private backend allocation IDs, never actual game entity handles. Root controller retains the separate checked session/generational-handle identity.",
    "No native movement/Death/weather event or frame scheduler is manufactured. Explicit source forces and visual clock remain controller inputs; repeated main/reflection/shadow draws must not step physics.",
    "The supplied adapter is portable and I/O-free; Node-only QA adapters are not proposed browser loaders. Dynamic renderer/GPU integration is a separate isolated task.",
    "All previous frozen modules/reports remain unchanged; JS fast-path copies are experiments, not the recommended backend."
